&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Data Analyst to join our People Analytics team, based in Toronto. You&#39;ll report to the Senior Manager, People Analytics and serve as the first point of contact for incoming data requests across the People organization — triaging, scoping, and delivering on analytical needs ranging from quick ad-hoc pulls to fully built ThoughtSpot dashboards.&lt;/p&gt;
